This product was designed with inspiration from prior art:

  SCMKit — Source Code Management Attack Toolkit
  IBM X-Force Red (xforcered) / Brett Hawkins (h4wkst3r)
  https://github.com/xforcered/SCMKit

SCMKit is a Windows .NET adversary-simulation toolkit targeting Source Control
Management systems (GitHub Enterprise, GitLab Enterprise, Bitbucket Server),
organized into reconnaissance, privilege-escalation, and persistence modules.

covenant is an independent, clean-room, Linux-native Python reimplementation of
the *read-only reconnaissance and token-validation* concepts only, scoped for
authorized bug-bounty engagements. No SCMKit source code was copied; the
attribution above credits the original research and design that inspired this
tool's module taxonomy.
